SUMMARY:ONCRTX — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: ONCOR ELECTRIC DELIVERY (ONCRTX)\n\nDeal context:\nOncor Electric 
 Delivery Company LLC\, a regulated electricity transmission and distributi
 on business headquartered in Dallas\, Texas (the largest T&D system in Tex
 as\, serving 4.1 million customers)\, has mandated Citi\, RBC Capital Mark
 ets\, SMBC\, and The Toronto-Dominion Bank to arrange fixed income investo
 r meetings commencing June 8\, 2026\, with a group investor call on June 9
 \, 2026 at 11:30am AEST / 9:30am SGT. A potential 7-year and/or 10-year AU
 D-denominated fixed rate senior secured benchmark transaction under Oncor'
 s A$ Note Issuance Programme may follow\, subject to market conditions. Th
 e deal carries strong investment grade ratings of A2/A/A (Moody's/S&P/Fitc
 h) and represents an Australian dollar AMTN format issuance by a US utilit
 y issuer.
